ending), α=4.0 (62%). Parent: alpha_ablation_westd_cal256.（准备中）\\\\n- eval_sft_rasp_20_full: RASP post-SFT full GSM8K eval (N=1319, greedy, seed=42). N=100 result: 57%. Full eval provides statistical significance for RASP vs Standard comparison. Parent: sft_rasp_20.（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_standard_20_v8（准备中）\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_v8（准备中）\\\\n- alpha_ablation_westd_cal256: α ablation sweep (calibration=256, N=100). α∈{0.0,0.5,1.0,2.0,4.0} at 20% sparsity. Phase A (prune+eval) complete, Phase B (SFT) in progress. Note: calibration=256 differs from westb original (512), causing ~5% group selection differences.（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 2 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **sft_rasp_rlvr_20** (success): RASP-RLVR 20% post-prune SFT recovery (lr=2e-5, epochs=2). 验证反向 CKA scoring (保留冗余结构) 是否产生更好的 RLVR 恢复基础。对比 RASP SFT 和 Standard SFT。Parent: prune_rasp_rlvr_20.\\\\n- **grpo_standard_qwen_math** (killed): Qwen2.5-Math-7B Standard 20% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型验证 C2: Standard collapse gradient (transient dip+recovery). DeepSeek Standard: transient dip step ~60, recovery step ~90. 参数同 grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8。Parent: sft_standard_20_qwen_math.\\\\n- **grpo_rasp_qwen_math** (killed): Qwen2.5-Math-7B RASP 20% GRPO (100 steps, save_steps=5). 跨模型验证 C1/C2: GRPO collapse 是否在 Qwen Math 上复现。DeepSeek RASP collapse onset ~step 10 (permanent). 参数同 grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v9。Parent: sft_rasp_20_qwen_math.\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 52 / 负向 10 / 失败 12 / 共 84\\\\naccuracy: 0.5125 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\neos_rate: 0.9545 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-11672: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_stage2_standard_20_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\