 summary: GRPO v8 RASP collapse at step 20；不 kill，跑到 step 50 观察 Standard 是否也 collapse\\\\n  rationale: RASP v8 grad_norm≈0, frac_zero_std=0.9，与 v2/v5 同模式。Standard 暂时健康但 frac_zero_std\\\\n    上升中。需要区分两种情况：(a) 双方都 collapse = GRPO 对剪枝模型普遍失效（方法论贡献），(b) 只有 RASP collapse = CKA-aware\\\\n    pruning 反而损害 GRPO recovery（需 pivot）。step 50 checkpoint 是决策点。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: pivot_signal\\\\n    result: collapse at step 20\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: monitoring\\\\n    result: healthy but frac_zero_std rising\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D034\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: RASP step 30 硬性 kill 门槛设定；unpruned baseline GRPO 作为最高优先级 contingency\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立确认 RASP collapse 不可逆（v2/v5/v8 三版同模式）。Step 30 kill 条件：grad_norm<0.05\\\\n    OR frac_zero_std≥0.85 OR reward<0.03。释放的 GPU 第一优先级跑 unpruned baseline GRPO——Reviewer\\\\n    指出这是 claim \\\\\\\"GRPO 对剪枝模型失效\\\\\\\"的必需证据。如果 v8 双 collapse 确认，不再出 v9，转而将 GRPO 失败作为 Claim\\\\n    3 证据（recovery pathway matters），前提是 unpruned GRPO 正常工作。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: kill_candidate\\\\n    result: collapse, step 30 kill check\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: monitoring\\\\n    result: frac_zero_std rising\\\\n  - exp_id: unpruned_baseline_grpo\\\\n    role: planned_contingency\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Narrative pivot: tentatively adopt \\\\\\\"Pruning for Plasticity\\\\\\\" (A), hold\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Recovery Method Conditions Pruning\\\\\\\" (B) as contingency pending Standard GRPO\\\\n    v8 result'\\\\n  rationale: RASP GRPO 3次连续 collapse (v2/v5/v8) 直接否定原核心假设 \\\\\\\"CKA-aware pruning preserves\\\\n    RLVR-recoverable structures\\\\\\\"。Narrative A 有最强的机制解释（冗余=可塑性缓冲）和新颖性，但依赖 Standard GRPO\\\\n    v8 成功。若 Standard 也 collapse → 退到 Narrative B（pruning×recovery 交互效应）。不在 Standard\\\\n    v8 完成前重写 paper_framing.md。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: collapse (grad_norm=0.011, frac_zero_std=0.90)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v5\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v2\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: collapse\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pending_critical\\\\n    result: RUNNING step 30/100 HEALTHY\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 18:38 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Narrative pivot: 暂定 Narrative A (Pruning for Plasticity)，B 作 contingency，等\\\\n    Standard GRPO v8 + unpruned baseline 结果再正式改 framing'\\\\n  rationale: RASP GRPO 3次连续 collapse 否定原核心假设。Narrative A 机制解释最强（冗余=可塑性缓冲），但依赖 Standard\\\\n    GRPO 成功。若 Standard 也 collapse → fallback 到 B（recovery method × pruning strategy\\\\n    交互效应）。不提前改 paper_framing.md，避免基于未确认结果做不可逆改动。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: primary_evidence\\\\n    result: collapse (3rd consecutive)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: pending_pivotal\\\\n    result: running step 30/100 healthy\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: pending_control\\\\n    result: running step 0/100\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D039\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: Unpruned GRPO collapse invalidates \\\\\\\"pruning causes collapse\\\\\\\" premise; collapse\\\\n    ordering (RASP→Unpruned→Standard) becomes new core evidence; hold narrative commitment\\\\n    until Standard v8 completes\\\\n  rationale: Unpruned baseline GRPO 在 step 80 collapse (reward=0, frac_zero_std=1.0)，证明\\\\n    collapse 不是剪枝导致。但 collapse 顺序极其有意义：RASP (step ~10) → Unpruned (step ~80) → Standard\\\\n    (step 30+ still learning, reward 0.061+)。如果 Standard 完成 100 步不 collapse，story\\\\n    变为\\\\\\\"importance-based pruning stabilizes RLVR\\\\\\\"——比原 Narrative A 更 counterintuitive\\\\n    