\\\\\"，这比\\\\\\\"GRPO config issue\\\\\\\"更有论文价值。同时 RASP 跨服务器 10pp 差异可能与 calibration 样本数（256\\\\n    vs 512）有关，plan_014（CKA reliability analysis）优先级应提升。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: reference - collapse at step 80\\\\n    result: failed (disk full)\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: reference - collapse at step ~10\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_standard_v8\\\\n    role: pending - step 40+ healthy, ETA step 100 ~10:30 UTC\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D041\\\\n- id: D043\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: Standard v8 step 60 确认 collapse。三模型全 collapse 时间线：RASP(10) < Standard(60)\\\\n    < Unpruned(80)。N=1319 SFT eval 无显著差异（p=0.248）。原始 RASP 优势假设不成立，需 pivot narrative。\\\\n  rationale: '1) SFT recovery: RASP 61.5% vs Standard 59.3%，Δ=2.2pp, p=0.248 不显著——CKA-based\\\\n    pruning 在 SFT recovery 上没有统计优势。2) GRPO stability: collapse 时间线与冗余保留完美负相关——RASP\\\\n    移除最多冗余最快 collapse，Standard 次之，Unpruned 最慢。这说明 CKA-based scoring 恰好移除了 GRPO 训练所需的冗余结构。3)\\\\n    Paper pivot 方向：从\\\\\\\"RASP enables better recovery\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"pruning-trainability tradeoff\\\\\\\"——方法论贡献是分析框架，不是新\\\\n    SOTA。collapse timeline 是最强数据点。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_standard_20_v8\\\\n    role: Standard collapse at step 60\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_stage2_rasp_20_v8\\\\n    role: RASP collapse at step ~10\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: grpo_unpruned_baseline\\\\n    role: Unpruned collapse at step ~80\\\\n    result: failed\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_sft_standard_full_westd\\\\n    role: Standard SFT 59.29%\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: eval_sft_rasp_full_westd\\\\n    role: RASP SFT 61.49%\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D042\\\\n- id: D044\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:41 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Major narrative pivot: from \\\\\\\"RASP enables better RLVR recovery\\\\\\\" to \\\\\\\"GRPO\\\\n    fails on pruned