{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01R459VLChTfvUSt3vfP14GP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AdJ4rsaNaAsxaHD8274sps","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"recovery_aware_struct_prune","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":21367,"cache_read_input_tokens":22724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":21367,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":41,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tt3sJKPZCCFEpypJ9pznT3","session_id":"87456414-598d-4dd4-8776-aaed1b39d708","uuid":"3ca00db8-988a-443a-adab-445e7ae89060"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AdJ4rsaNaAsxaHD8274sps","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_17/projects/recovery_aware_struct_prune/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: Qwen Math EOS Token Bug（所有 Qwen Math 模型受影响）\\\\n- `generation_config.json` 的 `eos_token_id` 只有 `[151643]` (`<|endoftext|>`)\\\\n- 缺少 `[151645]` (`<|im_end|>`)——模型学会在回答结束时生成 `<|im_end|>` 但 generate() 不停止\\\\n- 导致每 sample 生成满 max_tokens (4096 tokens, ~5min/sample)\\\\n- **修复**: eval_gsm8k.py 的 generate() 加 `eos_token_id=[151643, 151645]`（一处改全局生效）\\\\n- GRPO 修复：train_grpo_v5.py 加 `model.generation_config = GenerationConfig.from_pretrained(args.model_path)`\\\\n- 影响范围：sft_qwen_math_rasp_20, sft_qwen_math_standard_20, 以及任何 Qwen2.5 系列模型\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: sft_recovery.py 参数名（踩坑记录）\\\\n- 正确参数名：`--learning_rate`, `--num_train_epochs`, `--gradient_accumulation_steps`, `--batch_size`, `--max_seq_len`, `--gpu`, `--seed`\\\\n- **错误**：--lr, --epochs, --grad_accum（会 EXIT_CODE=2）\\\\n- 启动命令示例：`python src/sft_recovery.py --model_path <path> --output_dir <path> --gpu 1 --learning_rate 2e-5 --num_train_epochs 2 --batch_size 1 --gradient_accumulation_steps 8 --max_seq_len 2048 --seed 42`\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: RASP-RLVR Group Selection — 与 Standard 近似\\\\n- RASP-RLVR (score = importance × cka^α) 的 per-layer pruning pattern 与 Standard (importance only) 极其相似\\\\n- 仅 RASP (importance × (1-cka)^α) 的 pattern 显著不同\\\\n- 原因：cka^α 对 importance 的调制幅度小，(1-cka)^α 的惩罚效应才是 RASP 独特 pattern 的来源\\\\n- 数据：`results/group_selection_comparison.json` + `.csv` on westb\\\\n- **但 SFT+GRPO 阶段仍可能有差异**——即使结构相似，微小的 group 差异可能影响 RLVR 恢复\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: westb↔westd SCP 不通\\\\n- 两台服务器间无 SSH key 互信，Permission denied\\\\n- 模型传输需通过中间节点或其他方式（HuggingFace Hub / 本地中转）\\\\n- 影响：无法将 westb 上的模型直接传到 westd\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: Unpruned GRPO v2 — Reward-Accuracy Decoupling 定量确认\\\\n- Step 100: accuracy 81.27% (1072/1319) = SFT baseline 完全一致（同一批 1072 题正确）\\\\n- Step 90: accuracy 80.59% (1063/1319)，训练后期 accuracy 稳定\\\\n- Reward 从 0.425 上升至 0.669（peak step 80），但 accuracy 零提升\\\\n- **结论**：GRPO+GSM8K+greedy 下 reward 优化不编码推理能力提升——纯 reward hacking\\\\n- 与 pruned 模型对比：pruned 也无 accuracy 提升（RASP 60.65% ≈ SFT 61.49%，Standard 58.91% ≈ SFT 59.29%），但 pruned 额外有 collapse 问题\\\\n- **区分 v1 vs v2**：v1 (grpo_unpruned_baseline) 无 SFT 步骤设计错误，也 collapse；v2 修复后（SFT→GRPO）不 collapse\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: α Ablation Sweep westb (cal=512) — 非单调 U 形确认\\\\n- α=0.0→27%, α=0.25→23%, α=0.5→22%, α=1.0→31%, α=2.0→36%\\\\n- 与 westd (cal=256) 对比：两者都呈非单调 U 形。小 α (0.25-0.5) 引入噪声反而更差\\\\n- α=1.0 是精度-生成质量最佳平衡（31%, EOS 92%, avg_len 733）\\\\n- α=2.0 精度最高但 EOS 仅 59%——可能是\\\\\\\"暴力搜索\\\\\\\"（长输出碰运气）\\\\n- **Claim 2 支撑：α 显著影响 post-prune reasoning retention，最优区间 α∈[1.0, 2.0]**\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: sft_unpruned_baseline — 全量模型 SFT 基线\\\\n- Unpruned SFT: loss 0.332, token_acc 0.909（vs 剪枝模型 loss 0.64, token_acc 0.83）\\\\n- 全量参数模型学习能力明显更强，8pp token_accuracy 差异\\\\n- N=1319 eval: 81.27%\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: RASP GRPO v9 — save_steps=5 捕获 collapse 前 peak\\\\n- PID 566666, westb cuda:0, wandb mrikafz3\\\\n- save_steps=5, save_total_limit=5, max_steps=30\\\\n- 预计 step 5/10 有 checkpoint（RASP collapse onset ~step 10）\\\\n- step-5 eval = 60.65% (≈ SFT 61.49%)，确认 collapse 前 accuracy 无提升\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: N=1319 Full Eval — RASP vs Standard SFT 无显著差异\\\\n- westd N=1319: Standard 59.29% ±1.35%, RASP 61.49% ±1.34%\\\\n- Δ(RASP - Standard) = +2.20pp, z=1.154, **p=0.248, 不显著**, 95% CI = [-1.53, +5.93]pp\\\\n- **结论：post-SFT 两种 pruning 方法恢复能力无统计差异，论文 Claim 不能基于 SFT accuracy 差异**\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: Unpruned GRPO baseline v1 COLLAPSE — 设计缺陷\\\\n- v1 (grpo_unpruned_baseline) 无 SFT 步骤，直接 base model → GRPO\\\\n- 结果：peak reward 0.044 (step 20) → step 80 collapse → step 100 全零\\\\n- **D041 判定无效**：不公平对照（pruned models 有 SFT 而 unpruned 没有）\\\\n- v2 修复：加入 SFT 步骤后 100 步稳定训练、无 collapse\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: 文献搜索 — Pruning + RL Stability (Narrative A 支撑)\\\\n- **无直接先例**: 没有论文报告 pruning → GRPO/RLVR collapse。强新颖性。\\\\n- **Top 引用**: ①Dohare Nature 2024 ②Ma ICML 2025 ③Obando-Ceron ICML 2024 ④Zheng GSPO 2025\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: RASP GRPO 3x collapse + 零 checkpoint\\\\n- RASP GRPO v2/v5/v8 全部 collapse，v2-v8 全版本零 checkpoint（save_steps 大于 collapse 步数）\\\\n- v9 (save_steps=5) 是修复方案\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: 三方 post-SFT 对比 — 论文核心数据点\\\\n- **Standard 64% > RASP 57% > GraSP 41%** (N=100, greedy, seed=42, westb)\\\\n- GraSP vs Standard: p=0.001，统计显著\\\\n- α ablation: SFT 下 α 无显著趋势（α=0.0 64%, α=1.0 57%, α=2.0 62%, α=4.0 62%）\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-15: 代码与环境备忘\\\\n- westd eval 脚本必须从 westb 同步（含 apply_chat_template），旧版在 /root/autodl-tmp/ 下\\\\n- sft_recovery.py `--gpu` 参数覆盖外层 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES（第 19-22 行）——启动时直接传正确 --gpu N\\\\n- eval_gsm8k.py 默认: seed=42, greedy\\\\n- eval_gsm8k.py **不支持** --gpu 参数，必须用 CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES 环境变量\\\\n- westb 磁盘：清理后可用空间充足（旧 RASP GRPO v2-v8 目录已清理）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4339, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tt3sJKPZCCFEpypJ9pznT3","session_id":"87456414-598d-4dd4-8776-aaed1b39d708","uuid":"5e6ffe5d-f73f-4c2f-926c-ae82b3f00aa7","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:41:59.395Z"}
